---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About Us | HVAC Repair Phoenixville PA" description="Local licensed HVAC technicians serving Phoenixville and Chester County with same-day repair, honest pricing, and workmanship guarantees.">
  <section class="page-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <h1>About HVAC Repair Phoenixville</h1>
      <p>Your local specialists for heating and cooling comfort.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section">
    <div class="container prose">
      <p>We are a Phoenixville-based HVAC team dedicated to fast, honest repairs for homes across Chester County. From emergency no-heat calls in January to mid-summer AC failures, we show up prepared, explain findings clearly, and stand behind our work.</p>
      <h2>What Sets Us Apart</h2>
      <ul>
        <li>Licensed and insured technicians familiar with local housing and climate</li>
        <li>Stocked service vehicles for first-visit fixes whenever possible</li>
        <li>Upfront written estimates — no surprises</li>
        <li>24/7 availability for true emergencies</li>
        <li>Workmanship guarantee on every repair</li>
      </ul>
      <h2>Service Area</h2>
      <p>Based at 25 Gay St, Phoenixville, PA 19460. We regularly serve Phoenixville, Spring City, Royersford, Collegeville, Malvern, King of Prussia, West Chester, Pottstown, and surrounding communities in Chester and nearby Montgomery County.</p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
